id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
41543::$$$message_0311_0000_0000$$$::"I can't tell if the artist was running ragged or on a weird high when the game was getting closer to going gold."::
41544::$$$message_0311_0001_0000$$$::"Not unlike the battlefield."::
41545::$$$message_0311_0002_0000$$$::"When the character artist was working on these, he was in a ghastly state of drawing without any rest, [wvl]pa[wvl canskip=0 time=150]n[wvl canskip=0 time=150]t[wvl canskip=0 time=150]ing and [wvl canskip=0 time=150]gr[wvl canskip=0 time=150]o[wvl canskip=0 time=150]a[wvl canskip=0 time=150]ni[wvl canskip=0 time=150]ng.[wvl canskip=0 time=150]"::
41546::$$$message_0311_0003_0000$$$::"We've seen once again for ourselves the karmic consequences of a maid fetish. It's practically a mortal sin."::
41547::$$$message_0311_0004_0000$$$::"Yeah."::
41548::$$$message_0311_0005_0000$$$::"Even this ema gallery mode was actually added just as a way to look at the maids' bare legs.[lr]::
41549::$$$message_0311_0005_0001$$$::...Wait, Saber,[wvl canskip=0 time=400] we're talking about you, though."::
41550::$$$message_0311_0006_0000$$$::"Is it not gratifying to have more outfits, in any case?"::
41551::$$$message_0311_0007_0000$$$::"Oh? [wvl canskip=0 time=400]You want us to behold your divine feet, [wvl canskip=0 time=400]then?[lr]::
41552::$$$message_0311_0007_0001$$$::Are you trying to be the Holy Mother, or something!?"::
